{"seq":2,"slug":"breaking-change-detection","title":"破坏性变更检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/schema-evolution-data-contracts/validation/breaking-change-detection","wordCount":1509,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"破坏性变更检测\">破坏性变更检测</h1><p>契约测试验证的是&quot;当前代码是否符合当前契约&quot;。破坏性变更检测回答的是另一个问题：<strong>当有人提交了一个 schema 修改时，这个修改是否会破坏现有消费者？</strong> 它在 PR 阶段——代码合入之前——就给出答案，让审查者和作者立刻看到&quot;这次改动是安全的&quot;或&quot;这次改动是破坏性的，需要走迁移流程&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>破坏性变更检测回答&quot;这次 schema 改动是否会破坏现有消费者&quot;</strong>，并在 PR 阶段（代码合入之前）给出答案，而非等到生产环境暴露。</li>\n<li><strong>本质是两个版本之间的 diff 分析</strong>：输入 PR 分支新版本与基线版本，输出兼容、破坏性、需人工判断三类判定。</li>\n<li><strong>算法即兼容性规则的自动化执行</strong>：以 Avro BACKWARD 为例，需验证被删字段在旧 schema 有默认值、新增字段在新 schema 有默认值，保证解析器能反序列化所有旧数据。</li>\n<li><strong>只覆盖结构层面</strong>：纯粹的结构 diff 无法检测语义变更（字段含义改变但类型不变），这部分仍需人工审查 + 契约测试补充。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"检测的本质-两个版本之间的-diff-分析\">检测的本质：两个版本之间的 Diff 分析</h2><p>破坏性变更检测的输入是两个 schema 版本（通常是 PR 分支中的新版本 vs 主分支的当前版本），输出是一个分类判定：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>兼容</strong>：变更在配置的兼容性模式下合法，可以直接合入</li>\n<li><strong>破坏性</strong>：变更违反兼容性规则，需要迁移策略</li>\n<li><strong>需人工判断</strong>：语义变更（如 description 修改、默认值调整）机器无法确定是否有影响</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    PR[PR 提交 schema 变更] --&gt; Fetch[获取基线版本&lt;br/&gt;main 分支 / Registry latest]&#10;    Fetch --&gt; Diff[计算结构性 diff]&#10;    Diff --&gt; Classify{变更分类}&#10;    Classify --&gt;|字段新增 带默认值| Safe[兼容 ✓]&#10;    Classify --&gt;|字段删除 / 类型变更| Break[破坏性 ✗]&#10;    Classify --&gt;|description 修改| Review[需人工判断 ?]&#10;    Safe --&gt; Pass[CI 通过]&#10;    Break --&gt; Block[CI 阻断 + 建议迁移路径]&#10;    Review --&gt; Label[标记需审查]\">flowchart TD\n    PR[PR 提交 schema 变更] --&gt; Fetch[获取基线版本&lt;br/&gt;main 分支 / Registry latest]\n    Fetch --&gt; Diff[计算结构性 diff]\n    Diff --&gt; Classify{变更分类}\n    Classify --&gt;|字段新增 带默认值| Safe[兼容 ✓]\n    Classify --&gt;|字段删除 / 类型变更| Break[破坏性 ✗]\n    Classify --&gt;|description 修改| Review[需人工判断 ?]\n    Safe --&gt; Pass[CI 通过]\n    Break --&gt; Block[CI 阻断 + 建议迁移路径]\n    Review --&gt; Label[标记需审查]</pre><h2 id=\"检测算法的核心逻辑\">检测算法的核心逻辑</h2><p>对于结构化 schema 格式，破坏性检测的算法本质是&quot;兼容性规则的自动化执行&quot;。以 Avro 的 BACKWARD 模式为例，检测器需要回答：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>给定 writer schema = 旧版本，reader schema = 新版本，Avro 解析器能否成功反序列化所有旧数据？</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>判定规则（形式化）：</p>\n<p>设旧 schema 字段集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{old}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，新 schema 字段集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{new}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。对于 BACKWARD 兼容性：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>:</mo><mi>f</mi><mtext> has default in </mtext><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall f \\in F_{old} \\setminus F_{new}: f \\text{ has default in } F_{old}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∖</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> has default in </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即：旧 schema 中有但新 schema 中没有的字段（被删除的字段），在旧 schema 中必须有默认值——否则新 reader 遇到旧数据中的该字段时无法处理。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>:</mo><mi>f</mi><mtext> has default in </mtext><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall f \\in F_{new} \\setminus F_{old}: f \\text{ has default in } F_{new}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∖</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> has default in </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即：新 schema 中有但旧 schema 中没有的字段（新增的字段），在新 schema 中必须有默认值——否则旧数据中缺少该字段时新 reader 无法填充。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工具生态\">工具生态</h2><h3 id=\"schema-registry-api\">Schema Registry API</h3><p>最直接的检测方式是调用 Schema Registry 的兼容性检查 API：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 检查新 schema 是否与 subject 的历史版本兼容&#10;POST /compatibility/subjects/{subject}/versions/latest&#10;Content-Type: application/json&#10;&#10;{&#10;  &quot;schema&quot;: &quot;{新 schema JSON 内容}&quot;,&#10;  &quot;schemaType&quot;: &quot;AVRO&quot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;# 响应&#10;# 兼容: {&quot;is_compatible&quot;: true}&#10;# 不兼容: {&quot;is_compatible&quot;: false, &quot;messages&quot;: [&quot;...&quot;]}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 检查新 schema 是否与 subject 的历史版本兼容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">POST</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /compatibility/subjects/{subject}/versions/latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Content-Type:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> application/json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  \"schema\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"{新 schema JSON 内容}\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  \"schemaType\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"AVRO\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 响应</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 兼容: {\"is_compatible\": true}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 不兼容: {\"is_compatible\": false, \"messages\": [\"...\"]}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>优势</strong>：使用 Registry 的官方逻辑，与运行时行为一致。\n<strong>劣势</strong>：需要网络连接到 Registry；无法在 Registry 不存在时（如 Protobuf-only 项目）使用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"buf-protobuf-专用\">buf（Protobuf 专用）</h3><p>buf 是 Protobuf 生态最成熟的 breaking change 检测工具：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 与 main 分支对比检测&#10;buf breaking --against .git#branch=main&#10;&#10;# 输出&#10;# proto/order.proto:8:3: Field &quot;1&quot; on message &quot;OrderEvent&quot;&#10;#   changed type from &quot;int32&quot; to &quot;int64&quot;.&#10;# proto/order.proto:12:3: Field &quot;4&quot; with name &quot;status&quot; on&#10;#   message &quot;OrderEvent&quot; was deleted without being reserved.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 与 main 分支对比检测</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">buf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> breaking</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --against</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .git#branch=main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 输出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># proto/order.proto:8:3: Field \"1\" on message \"OrderEvent\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   changed type from \"int32\" to \"int64\".</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># proto/order.proto:12:3: Field \"4\" with name \"status\" on</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   message \"OrderEvent\" was deleted without being reserved.</span></span></code></pre></div><p>buf 的检测规则可以自定义级别：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>FILE</code>：文件级检查（最宽松）</li>\n<li><code>PACKAGE</code>：包级检查</li>\n<li><code>WIRE</code>：线缆级兼容检查</li>\n<li><code>WIRE_JSON</code>：包括 JSON 序列化兼容性</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"openapi-diff-json-schema-openapi\">openapi-diff（JSON Schema / OpenAPI）</h3><p>针对 REST API 的 schema 变更检测：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"openapi-diff old-spec.yaml new-spec.yaml --fail-on-incompatible&#10;&#10;# 输出分类&#10;# BREAKING:&#10;#   - DELETE /orders/{id}: removed endpoint&#10;#   - POST /orders: request body property &#39;amount&#39; type changed string -&gt; integer&#10;# NON-BREAKING:&#10;#   - POST /orders: added optional property &#39;note&#39; to request body\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">openapi-diff</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> old-spec.yaml</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> new-spec.yaml</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --fail-on-incompatible</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 输出分类</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># BREAKING:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   - DELETE /orders/{id}: removed endpoint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   - POST /orders: request body property 'amount' type changed string -> integer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># NON-BREAKING:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   - POST /orders: added optional property 'note' to request body</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"工具对比\">工具对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>格式支持</th>\n<th>CI 集成</th>\n<th>检测精度</th>\n<th>自定义规则</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Schema Registry API</td>\n<td>Avro/Protobuf/JSON Schema</td>\n<td>REST 调用</td>\n<td>高（官方逻辑）</td>\n<td>通过兼容性模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>buf</td>\n<td>Protobuf</td>\n<td>GitHub Action / CLI</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>自定义规则集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>openapi-diff</td>\n<td>OpenAPI/JSON Schema</td>\n<td>CLI / Maven</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>json-schema-diff</td>\n<td>JSON Schema</td>\n<td>npm CLI</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>avro-tools</td>\n<td>Avro</td>\n<td>CLI</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Apicurio Registry</td>\n<td>多格式</td>\n<td>REST API</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>兼容性模式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"ci-cd-集成模式\">CI/CD 集成模式</h2><p>破坏性变更检测应该在 CI 的最早阶段执行——PR 创建时即触发，不等到合入后。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[PR 创建/更新] --&gt; B[检出基线 schema]&#10;    B --&gt; C[运行 breaking 检测]&#10;    C --&gt; D{结果}&#10;    D --&gt;|兼容| E[PR 标记 safe-to-merge]&#10;    D --&gt;|破坏性| F[PR 阻断 + 评论&lt;br/&gt;列出影响的消费者&lt;br/&gt;建议迁移策略]&#10;    D --&gt;|需审查| G[PR 标记 needs-review&lt;br/&gt;通知数据治理团队]&#10;    F --&gt; H[作者选择迁移策略]&#10;    H --&gt; I[提交迁移计划]&#10;    I --&gt; C\">flowchart LR\n    A[PR 创建/更新] --&gt; B[检出基线 schema]\n    B --&gt; C[运行 breaking 检测]\n    C --&gt; D{结果}\n    D --&gt;|兼容| E[PR 标记 safe-to-merge]\n    D --&gt;|破坏性| F[PR 阻断 + 评论&lt;br/&gt;列出影响的消费者&lt;br/&gt;建议迁移策略]\n    D --&gt;|需审查| G[PR 标记 needs-review&lt;br/&gt;通知数据治理团队]\n    F --&gt; H[作者选择迁移策略]\n    H --&gt; I[提交迁移计划]\n    I --&gt; C</pre><p><strong>GitHub Actions 示例（buf + Protobuf）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"name: Schema Breaking Change Check&#10;on: [pull_request]&#10;jobs:&#10;  breaking:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - uses: bufbuild/buf-setup-action@v1&#10;      - uses: bufbuild/buf-breaking-action@v1&#10;        with:&#10;          against: &#39;https://github.com/${{ github.repository }}.git#branch=main&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Schema Breaking Change Check</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pull_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  breaking</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">bufbuild/buf-setup-action@v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">bufbuild/buf-breaking-action@v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          against</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://github.com/${{ github.repository }}.git#branch=main'</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"检测结果的分级响应\">检测结果的分级响应</h2><p>不是所有破坏性变更都应该被同等对待。按影响面分级响应：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>影响面</th>\n<th>判定方式</th>\n<th>响应</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无消费者依赖</td>\n<td>查询 Registry 的 consumer 注册</td>\n<td>自动通过（无人受影响）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>少量已知消费者</td>\n<td>消费者清单明确</td>\n<td>通知消费者 + 协商窗口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大量/未知消费者</td>\n<td>公共 topic、广播事件</td>\n<td>阻断 + 必须走正式迁移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核心业务数据</td>\n<td>标记为 critical subject</td>\n<td>需数据治理团队审批</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"误报与漏报的处理\">误报与漏报的处理</h2><p><strong>误报</strong>（实际兼容但被报为破坏性）：常见于 JSON Schema 的 <code>additionalProperties</code> 变更、description-only 修改、annotation 变更。处理：添加白名单规则或 <code>// buf:lint:ignore</code> 注释。</p>\n<p><strong>漏报</strong>（实际破坏但未被检测）：常见于语义变更（字段含义改变但类型不变、枚举值的业务含义调整）。处理：纯结构检测无法覆盖，需要结合 <a href=\"contract-testing\">契约测试</a> 中的语义验证。</p>\n<p>机器检测覆盖结构层面的大部分破坏性变更；语义层面的变更仍需人工审查。如何把机器检测和人工审查组织成一个可执行的治理流程，见 <a href=\"governance-automation\">治理自动化</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>破坏性变更检测把兼容性规则自动化，在 PR 阶段就对&quot;这次改动是否破坏消费者&quot;给出结论，让审查者和作者立刻看到结果。</li>\n<li>算法本质是版本间 diff 分析加兼容性规则判定，输入两个 schema 版本，输出兼容/破坏性/需人工判断。</li>\n<li>工具生态按格式分工：Schema Registry API（官方逻辑、与运行时一致）、buf（Protobuf 最成熟）、openapi-diff（REST API）、Apicurio（多格式）。</li>\n<li>检测应放在 CI 最早阶段，PR 创建即触发，不兼容时阻断并给出建议迁移路径。</li>\n<li>结果按影响面分级响应：无消费者自动通过、少量已知消费者协商窗口、大量未知消费者必须走正式迁移、核心业务数据需治理团队审批。</li>\n<li>需处理误报（description-only 修改、annotation 变更）与漏报（语义变更），后者的兜底是契约测试的语义验证。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"破坏性变更检测","id":"破坏性变更检测"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"检测的本质：两个版本之间的 Diff 分析","id":"检测的本质-两个版本之间的-diff-分析"},{"level":2,"text":"检测算法的核心逻辑","id":"检测算法的核心逻辑"},{"level":2,"text":"工具生态","id":"工具生态"},{"level":3,"text":"Schema Registry API","id":"schema-registry-api"},{"level":3,"text":"buf（Protobuf 专用）","id":"buf-protobuf-专用"},{"level":3,"text":"openapi-diff（JSON Schema / OpenAPI）","id":"openapi-diff-json-schema-openapi"},{"level":3,"text":"工具对比","id":"工具对比"},{"level":2,"text":"CI/CD 集成模式","id":"ci-cd-集成模式"},{"level":2,"text":"检测结果的分级响应","id":"检测结果的分级响应"},{"level":2,"text":"误报与漏报的处理","id":"误报与漏报的处理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"契约测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/schema-evolution-data-contracts/validation/contract-testing"},"next":{"title":"治理自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/schema-evolution-data-contracts/validation/governance-automation"}}